Well, you don't *need* genocide to ascend (of course, it can reduce some 
annoyances) and a silver saber does not belong on a wish list.  You may 
find a saber on a captain in the castle or in the castle storeroom.  If 
you're a valk you don't need really great AC if you've done the quest 
anyway.  The Orb of Fate grants half physical and spell damage.  So you 
really only need about half the ac as usual!  Both my Illiterate valk and 
atheist valk took advantage of that.  I would also hold off on speed boots 
until after done with the castle and VotD.  I can't tell you how many 
times I've wished for something in the castle only to find it on the next 
level down.  If medusa lacked lev boots, you may want a ring of levitation 
to help get to the storerooms in the castle and across the moat sans 
boulder or wand of cold.  You may also want to consider a means of 
teleport control, likely a ring.  You can use the level teleport ability 
of the orb to keep a stash (I'd say VotD since you can teleport there from 
gehennom or above.  Have fun!

